WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.870
I was born a puppeteer.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.330
A puppet with a mission.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:10.040
That is Shirogane. That is who I am.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.670
Enough of this chit chat.
Listen here, Shirogane.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.340
You're not a puppet.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.170
No, don't be stupid. You'll die!

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:25.050
I'm letting go of the crybaby
I used to be.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.100
If I survive...

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:33.650
I'm going to laugh all the time!

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.730
He's like a whole different person.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.700
Those eyes. They're a beast's eyes.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.660
Thirsty for life.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:01.970
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:06.970
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:11.640
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:16.230
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:20.900
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:25.820
My hands are full of emptiness

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:30.450
Please, just once, nod for me

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:35.330
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:40.300
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:44.970
All the rest can just burn away

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:49.600
What's right for me is for me alone

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:54.850
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.320
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:03.070
For one single reason

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:11.120
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.670
#4 Swirling Tiger

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:22.130
Come on,
be on my side.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:25.090
My dad left me
his fortune,

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.720
so I'll pay however much you want.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:33.520
This boy, he came falling from the sky,

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.940
and now he's negotiating
with the hitman sent to kill him.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.190
Such determination.

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:47.280
Me, a famed Kuroga puppeteer,
overwhelmed by a boy?

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.580
Hold on, did you jump from there?

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:55.160
Yeah, I had to get away from Uncle Zenji.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.330
You're unbelievable.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:04.340
And even though it was a coincidence,
you saved my life.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:10.300
But we follow a certain code of conduct.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:15.140
No matter how much you're willing to pay,
we can't betray our clients.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.850
Then read this.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:24.110
What, we Kuroga were just
lab rats to make stronger puppets?

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:28.200
And now that they don't need us,
we're to kill each other off?

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.580
So?

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:40.540
How much will you pay us?

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.920
How's your injury?

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.170
It's nothing.
I'm more worried about Masaru.

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:51.090
There has to be an exit somewhere.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.390
We must find Mr. Masaru, fast.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.310
Don't think you've won this game.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.850
We're taking you down with us.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.650
Nobody can stop it now.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.990
One hour left.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:11.410
You're all going to hell.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:22.250
Damn that Masaru. Dying like that.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:27.710
If he'd become my son,
that fortune would've been mine.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:34.600
It's me. Did you find Masaru's body?

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.100
Actually, he's...

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.560
He's alive?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:42.520
He's taken the Kidnap Team's Grimaldi
and is headed your way.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:51.700
Masaru! And... the Slaughter Team?

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:56.410
Excuse our intrusion.
This little boy needs to talk to you.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.330
Uncle, stop all this, please. I beg you.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:03.420
I want to help Shirogane and Narumi.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.470
It seems like luck is still with me.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:13.720
Shirogane! Narumi!

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:16.470
Damn it, he caught us off guard.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.270
Wait Yamanaka, don't kill them.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:26.810
You've caused quite a commotion,
but I'm glad you're still alive.

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:30.740
You know what I want, right?

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.870
To adopt me.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.580
That's right.
All you have to do is say yes.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.960
Yamanaka, wring them a bit.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.630
Hear that? Lovely.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.050
Stop it, don't!

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:56.930
Masaru.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.260
He's watching.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:05.900
Gosh, this feels so nice.
It tickles, actually.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:11.690
Absolutely.
Don't worry about us, Mr. Masaru!

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:15.400
That's right, don't listen to that baboon.

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:16.610
Shut up!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.580
I could kill them very easily.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.080
So, how about it Masaru?

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:36.090
I... I'll be your son.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:41.390
Good boy! From now on, I am your father.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.680
But you have to let them go!

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.900
Of course. Anything my darling son wishes.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:52.070
Let's go to the pagoda out back.
You can meet them there.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.160
Come, Masaru.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.240
Hold on a sec, little boy.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.410
You're being cheated.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.670
Just think about it.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.710
Those two know about
all that went on here.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:14.550
You think he'd just let them go?

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:22.470
Is that true, Uncle?

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:25.640
Yup.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:31.150
I'm thinking about having them
jump from the pagoda.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:38.700
You're an awful man.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:44.580
But what can you do about it, Masaru?

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.330
Shirogane, Narumi.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.630
You...

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.760
jerk!

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.560
-My leg!
-Damn...

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:09.730
Let's go, little boy!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.190
Yeah, but...

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:16.940
With the way this mansion is laid out,
we'll never make it in time.

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:19.070
Then what do we do?

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:22.530
I can't disarm it!

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:26.330
It'll blow this whole place up!

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.830
It stopped.
This must be the top of the pagoda.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.590
What the hell are they up to?

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.970
What's wrong, Shirogane?

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:44.550
When I was a child...

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.970
I used to be locked up
in a room like this.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:50.980
I just remembered.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:57.730
Outside the window...

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.320
were hands working a puppet.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.250
I'm scared.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.250
I can see it... that window...

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:19.340
The hands that control me.

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.840
Smile, Shirogane.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.220
Just raise the corners of your mouth.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:34.020
Not even the scariest things
have a chance against a smile.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:41.490
You just said something
a man once said to me long ago.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:47.990
Smile, Shirogane.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:52.500
You're a poor puppet
who's forgotten how to smile.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.630
But you'll be able to smile someday.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.210
Believe me.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.800
His name was Shoji Saiga.

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.590
He was Mr. Masaru's grandfather.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:09.510
Shirogane, protect young Masaru.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:16.190
Protect him,
and you won't be a puppet anymore.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.190
You'll smile again.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:25.030
So that's why you look after Masaru.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:27.820
Your arm feels strange.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:31.080
-I didn't mean...
-It's fine.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:34.710
I said it was strange because...

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.960
the warmest I'd ever felt
was from Mr. Shoji's words.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:45.220
But I can feel something even warmer
from your arm.

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:52.350
No way, you want to jump
from here to the pagoda?

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:58.440
Considering the length of the premises,
Grimaldi's speed should be enough.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:05.240
This boy analyzed distance and speed
amidst all this chaos?

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:10.410
Besides, I trust you.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:18.170
All right then.
As long as you pay me.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.050
We're slipping.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:30.050
Give me Grimaldi's neck! Hurry!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:38.480
Where did you learn to do that?

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.480
I watched you do it.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.740
Narumi, Shirogane!

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:50.860
-Masaru!
-Mr. Masaru!

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:53.530
I'm sorry, this is all my fault.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:57.200
Don't say that!
Look at you, you're all banged up.

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.250
Mr. Masaru!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.500
Ashihana, you bastard.
Masaru, get away from him!

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.550
It's okay, I hired him.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.590
He's on our side now.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:11.890
He's right.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:15.510
But I can't move a single finger.

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:19.140
I don't think I can work anymore.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.400
Sorry.

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:26.570
Who'd have thought
you'd fly Grimaldi over here?

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:28.900
But it's game over.

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:32.490
No! Narumi and Shirogane
went through all this for me.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.830
Now I've got to save them!

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:37.160
You've got guts.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:43.290
Let's see if you're still so brave
when you've had an arm cut off.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:46.340
Take mine instead!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.470
-I'll take both.
-Wait.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:55.430
No...

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:59.640
You've gotten strong, Masaru.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:03.940
But you've done more than enough.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.940
Leave it to us now.

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:11.860
Shirogane and I
will take care of the rest.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.910
His powers are enhanced
with spiritual force.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.830
It's called hard qigong. Remember that.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:28.130
Mr. Masaru. You're bruised all over.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:32.090
It's nothing.
I'm just glad to see your faces.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:41.270
All you adults bullying a little kid.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.350
You goddamn jerks!

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:49.610
Well, well. Not bad for an amateur.

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.320
You're Masaru's kidnapper.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:55.070
Yeah, I beat you then, remember?

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.540
So what?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:10.750
Narumi, he's so strong.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:13.300
Yes, it's because he's furious,

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.300
seeing you covered in bruises.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.060
He hates people
who kill like it's nothing.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:26.940
Narumi is probably always
fighting for somebody.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.980
I still don't fully understand it.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:32.230
But Mr. Masaru,

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:38.740
I envy Kato for that.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.750
Shirogane!

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:47.540
Are you okay?

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.960
Pay attention, young lady.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.670
Shirogane.

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.550
Take that...

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:58.300
Arlequin!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:02.720
Shirogane!

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:04.310
Run, Mr. Masaru.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.140
You're coming with me.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:09.810
Run, Masaru. Run!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.570
Run?

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.280
And leave them behind?

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.540
No!

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.920
I won't run.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.830
Mr. Masaru, please go!

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.470
I'm going to fight.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:41.090
How amusing.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:44.350
Little boy, puppeteering is difficult.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:47.350
An amateur child like you
could never do it.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.060
Mr. Masaru, you must run!

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:50.560
On your feet, Arlequin!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:55.030
Mr. Masaru.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:16:00.320
It takes even the most skilled people
years to master puppeteering.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.240
But you...

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:07.080
Sorry, Arlequin.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.540
I can't control you like Shirogane can.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.590
But there's one trick I do remember.

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.550
Les Arts Martiaux!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.050
Damn it.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.840
Swirling Tiger!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.730
What?

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:33.770
What's going on?

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:52.750
Are you okay, Masaru?

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:57.420
Shirogane.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:00.420
Hang in there, Shirogane.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.720
I'm fine.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.590
Like hell. We have to hurry.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.430
But how do we get out of here?

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.060
-Little boy.
-Mr. Ashihana.

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:11.270
This way. I think we can make it out.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:13.600
Let's go.

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:21.860
I set up a ropeway.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:23.950
Let's use it.

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:27.330
How do we know you won't cut it?

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:32.160
I've been hired by the little boy
for a hefty sum.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.330
I'll do my job.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.420
Then I'll hire you too.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.180
For 10 yen.

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:45.680
This better work.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:48.180
Don't you worry.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:53.310
Hold on, Shirogane.
We'll take you to a doctor.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.850
You hurry too.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:17:59.400
Masaru!

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.240
Mr. Masaru! I'll save you.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.360
You go on ahead.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.490
I could never desert you two!

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.990
You can't move with those legs.

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:12.500
We won't be long.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:16.000
I'll cross that rope with Masaru
before you know it.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.680
A ZONAPHA attack.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:29.600
I must laugh!

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:33.520
I have to laugh, or Kato will...

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:42.400
I can't laugh!

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:46.150
Why can't I laugh?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:49.120
I'm so sorry.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:59.380
Why are you apologizing
for not laughing?

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:04.260
You're so funny.

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:07.130
Kato.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.760
You go on ahead and get out of here.

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:12.390
Don't worry about Masaru. Go!

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:14.560
Kato!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.190
Masaru!

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.070
Narumi.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.080
Narumi!

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:46.550
I should've listened to old Grandpops
and followed in his footsteps.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:50.340
He was a clown.

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:55.390
He always bragged about
how great a job it was.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:57.600
If I'd been a clown,

00:19:58.190 --> 00:20:02.730
I could've made lots of kids
smile the way you do.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:04.860
Narumi.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:09.740
But hey, getting to meet you
was more than enough for me.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:15.200
Masaru, you keep on smiling.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.910
You can cry.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.750
You can clench your teeth.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:27.260
But other than that, you keep on smiling.

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.260
Narumi!

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:34.180
Keep your head down.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:38.100
But Narumi, look at you!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:42.690
If you're ever feeling lost,

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:47.780
think with your heart
and decide what you should do.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:53.990
And when you realize
that it's time to smile,

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.910
don't cry.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.960
Got it, Masaru?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:38.200
I'm alive.

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:41.290
We're alive, Narumi!

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.140
Narumi was gone.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:58.050
He gave me so many things,

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.220
and then left.

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.650
However, it felt as though the arm
he had left behind was protecting me.

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:16.910
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:19.240
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:23.620
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:28.460
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:34.840
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:40.060
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:44.600
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.730
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:53.440
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.610 --> 00:22:57.780
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:02.910
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:09.040
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:11.420
become free

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:14.050
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:16.340
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:20.850
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:21.010 --> 00:23:25.730
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:32.110
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
